div.p:
In addition General Franchet d’Esperey ordered General Chrétien to require by July 15, a certain number of guarantees
                    including, among others: 

Suppression of two divisions, one by July 15, the other by August 1;

Disbanding of the military school at Sofia;

Stopping the filling up again to a full complement in horses of the
                            cavalry and artillery;

Closing the arms repair factory of the Sofia arsenal.
